<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tool id="smart_library_report_generator" name="Smart Library Report Generator" version="0.1.0" profile="24.0">
    <description>merge HotSpot results into final mutation, library, and structure-viewer reports</description>
    <requirements>
        <requirement type="package">python</requirement>
    </requirements>
    <command detect_errors="exit_code"><![CDATA[
\${HOTSPOT_WIZARD_PYTHON:-python} '$__tool_directory__/run_smart_library_report_generator.py'
  --hotspots-tsv '$hotspots_tsv'
  --candidate-mutations '$candidate_mutations'
  --smart-library '$smart_library'
  --degenerate-codons '$degenerate_codons'
  --mutation-ddg '$mutation_ddg'
  --ranked-hotspots 'ranked_hotspots.tsv'
  --ranked-mutations 'ranked_mutations.tsv'
  --smart-library-design 'smart_library_design.tsv'
  --summary-html 'summary.html'
  --structure-viewer-html 'structure_viewer.html'
  --run-log 'run_log.txt'
  --project-title '$project_title'
  --top-n-hotspots '$top_n_hotspots'
  --top-n-mutations '$top_n_mutations'
  --max-viewer-residues '$max_viewer_residues'
#if str($structure.structure_mode) == "provided":
  --structure-pdb '$structure.structure_pdb'
#end if
    ]]></command>
    <inputs>
        <param name="hotspots_tsv" type="data" format="tabular" label="hotspot_residue_ranked.tsv"
            help="Output from Tool 6 Hotspot Residue Ranker." />
        <param name="candidate_mutations" type="data" format="tabular" label="candidate_mutations.tsv"
            help="Output from Tool 7 Mutation Designer." />
        <param name="smart_library" type="data" format="tabular" label="smart_library.tsv"
            help="Output from Tool 7 Mutation Designer." />
        <param name="degenerate_codons" type="data" format="tabular" label="degenerate_codons.tsv"
            help="Output from Tool 7 Mutation Designer." />
        <param name="mutation_ddg" type="data" format="tabular" label="mutation_ddg.tsv"
            help="Output from Tool 8 Stability Predictor." />
        <conditional name="structure">
            <param name="structure_mode" type="select" label="Optional structure for viewer">
                <option value="none" selected="true">No structure PDB</option>
                <option value="provided">Use structure PDB</option>
            </param>
            <when value="none" />
            <when value="provided">
                <param name="structure_pdb" type="data" format="pdb" label="Structure PDB" />
            </when>
        </conditional>
        <section name="report_options" title="Report options" expanded="true">
            <param name="project_title" type="text" value="HotSpot Smart Library Design Report" label="Project/report title" />
            <param name="top_n_hotspots" type="integer" value="50" min="1" label="Top hotspot rows in reports" />
            <param name="top_n_mutations" type="integer" value="100" min="1" label="Top mutation rows in reports" />
            <param name="max_viewer_residues" type="integer" value="80" min="1" label="Maximum residues highlighted in structure viewer" />
        </section>
    </inputs>
    <outputs>
        <data name="ranked_hotspots" format="tabular" from_work_dir="ranked_hotspots.tsv"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 01 ranked_hotspots.tsv" />
        <data name="ranked_mutations" format="tabular" from_work_dir="ranked_mutations.tsv"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 02 ranked_mutations.tsv" />
        <data name="smart_library_design" format="tabular" from_work_dir="smart_library_design.tsv"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 03 smart_library_design.tsv" />
        <data name="summary_html" format="html" from_work_dir="summary.html"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 04 summary.html" />
        <data name="structure_viewer_html" format="html" from_work_dir="structure_viewer.html"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 05 structure_viewer.html" />
        <data name="run_log" format="txt" from_work_dir="run_log.txt"
            label="${tool.name} on ${on_string} | 06 run_log.txt" />
    </outputs>
    <tests>
        <test expect_num_outputs="6">
            <param name="hotspots_tsv" value="hotspot_residue_ranked.tsv" ftype="tabular" />
            <param name="candidate_mutations" value="candidate_mutations.tsv" ftype="tabular" />
            <param name="smart_library" value="smart_library.tsv" ftype="tabular" />
            <param name="degenerate_codons" value="degenerate_codons.tsv" ftype="tabular" />
            <param name="mutation_ddg" value="mutation_ddg.tsv" ftype="tabular" />
            <param name="structure_mode" value="provided" />
            <param name="structure_pdb" value="foldx_input.pdb" ftype="pdb" />
            <output name="ranked_hotspots">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="best_ddg_kcal_per_mol" />
                    <has_text text="functional_hotspot" />
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <output name="ranked_mutations">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="foldx_mutation" />
                    <has_text text="acceptable" />
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <output name="summary_html">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="Final HotSpot smart-library report" />
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
            <output name="structure_viewer_html">
                <assert_contents>
                    <has_text text="PyMOL" />
                    <has_text text="Hotspot Residues" />
                </assert_contents>
            </output>
        </test>
    </tests>
    <help><![CDATA[
用途说明
--------

本工具是 HotSpot Wizard-like 蛋白半理性改造流程的 Tool 9，用于生成最终给实验人员查看的突变库设计报告。它不会重新运行 FoldX 或结构分析，而是合并前面步骤的结果并做排序、解释和可视化辅助。

输入
----

- `hotspot_residue_ranked.tsv`: Galaxy datatype 为 `tabular`，Tool 6 输出，包含 hotspot 位点、结构上下文、保守性和 mutability。
- `candidate_mutations.tsv`: Galaxy datatype 为 `tabular`，Tool 7 输出，包含推荐氨基酸替换及来源。
- `smart_library.tsv`: Galaxy datatype 为 `tabular`，Tool 7 输出，包含单点或多点 library 组合、理论库容量和设计理由。
- `degenerate_codons.tsv`: Galaxy datatype 为 `tabular`，Tool 7 输出，包含每个位点的简并密码子、覆盖氨基酸、额外氨基酸和覆盖率。
- `mutation_ddg.tsv`: Galaxy datatype 为 `tabular`，Tool 8 输出，包含 FoldX ΔΔG 和稳定性分类。
- `Structure PDB`: Galaxy datatype 为 `pdb`，可选。提供后会嵌入 `structure_viewer.html`，并生成 PyMOL/ChimeraX 选择命令。

输入一致性要求
--------------

所有 TSV 应来自同一轮 HotSpot workflow，且使用相同的 chain/residue numbering。若混用不同结构、不同 MSA 或不同编号体系，最终报告可能把突变、ΔΔG 和结构上下文错误合并。

输出
----

**ranked_hotspots.tsv**
  推荐突变位点表，包含功能/稳定性/consensus 等策略、pocket/tunnel/surface/core 信息、保守性分数、最佳突变、ΔΔG、简并密码子和库容量。

**ranked_mutations.tsv**
  推荐氨基酸替换表，合并候选来源、FoldX ΔΔG、稳定性分类和实验建议。

**smart_library_design.tsv**
  实验文库设计表，包含每个文库的位点、氨基酸集合、理论容量、简并密码子和稳定性风险统计。

**summary.html**
  面向实验人员的最终 HTML 报告。

**structure_viewer.html**
  结构查看和 hotspot selection 页面。若浏览器能加载 3Dmol.js，会自动显示结构；否则仍可使用 PyMOL/ChimeraX 命令。

输出使用建议
------------

- 给实验人员优先查看 `summary.html`、`ranked_mutations.tsv` 和 `smart_library_design.tsv`。
- `ranked_hotspots.tsv` 适合讨论位点选择逻辑。
- `structure_viewer.html` 适合定位候选位点，并把 PyMOL/ChimeraX selection 复制到结构软件中复核。

注意事项
--------

- 该报告是实验设计汇总，不替代实验验证。
- ΔΔG 解释沿用 Tool 8：`priority`、`acceptable`、`caution`、`high_risk`。
- 若不提供 PDB，structure viewer 仍会输出热点表和选择命令，但不会嵌入结构坐标。
    ]]></help>
    <citations />
</tool>
